Run scripts for the msp2 ensemble.

Default simulation runscripts for present day (PD; 2010) and pre-industrial
(PI; aerosols set to 1850). 

Contents
--------
pd, pi                 ensemble-member runscripts (take -o autoconv, -r accr,
                       -p sample number)

Note: machine configuration will likely drift over time; get in touch with the
authors for help reproducing the runs in the future, if desired.
